## 15. Licenciamento e Limites

### Funcionalidades
- Matriz de planos x features x quotas
- Precos inclusos e adicionais
- Indicadores de uso
- Avisos de limite

### Matriz de Planos

```typescript
interface Plan {
  id: string;
  name: string;           // Free, Starter, Pro, Enterprise
  price: {
    monthly: number;
    yearly: number;       // desconto anual
    currency: 'BRL' | 'USD';
  };
  features: PlanFeature[];
  quotas: PlanQuota[];
  addons: PlanAddon[];
}

interface PlanFeature {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  included: boolean;
}

interface PlanQuota {
  id: string;
  name: string;           // Usuarios, Storage, API calls
  limit: number | 'unlimited';
  unit: string;           // 'users', 'GB', 'requests/month'
}

interface PlanAddon {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  price: number;
  unit: string;           // 'per user', 'per GB', 'per 1000 requests'
}
```

### Exemplo de Matriz

| Feature/Quota | Free | Starter | Pro | Enterprise |
|---------------|------|---------|-----|------------|
| Usuarios | 3 | 10 | 50 | Ilimitado |
| Storage | 1 GB | 10 GB | 100 GB | Ilimitado |
| API calls/mes | 1.000 | 10.000 | 100.000 | Ilimitado |
| Suporte | Email | Email | Prioritario | Dedicado |
| SSO | - | - | Sim | Sim |
| Auditoria | - | Basica | Completa | Completa |
| Preco/mes | R$ 0 | R$ 49 | R$ 199 | Sob consulta |

